<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - KEMPEN H1 NET SOARS TO NLG 28.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE - KEMPEN H1 NET SOARS TO NLG 28.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.87 vs   1.30</p>
<p>    Net profit			    28.4  vs  12.4</p>
<p>    Total income			  65.9  vs  36.4</p>
<p>    Total costs			   23.9  vs  18.4</p>
<p>    Tax				     13.6  vs   5.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Merchant bank Kempen &amp; Co NV said in July it expected</p>
<p>the 1997 first-half net profit to have more than doubled from</p>
<p>the year-ago period's 12.4 million guilders.</p>
<p>    Net interest income		  4.2  vs   3.4</p>
<p>    Investment income		    1.3  vs   1.1</p>
<p>    Net fee income			49.4  vs  26.0</p>
<p>    Gain from fin transactions	11.1  vs   5.9</p>
<p>    Loan loss provision		  0.5  vs   0.5</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (guilders)  15.72 vs  12.24</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
